WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 13.5 · Strategy to Action: Plan, Deliver & Review
Milestones and dependencies

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Map only real dependencies, and plan what you’ll do if one slips.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Separate tasks that must wait from parallel ones.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Mark outside decisions and how uncertain they are.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. When a prerequisite slips, review later dates at once.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:23.800
An example: Vanita Weavers Cooperative (Cooperative · member-owned, India)

7
00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:31.000
“Vanita: festival yarn needs the working-capital loan approved by June; if not, we buy yarn only for confirmed orders.”

8
00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:33.400
You create your dependency map and milestones.

9
00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:37.400
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

10
00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:42.000
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
